## 17.1 Objective & TM4C bridge

Send and receive CAN frames. CAN runs cars, industrial machinery and a good deal of aerospace, so it is the bus to know for the automotive and defense tiers on your target list — Tesla, Anduril and the primes all live on it.

> **[TM4C BRIDGE]**
>
> The TM4C had a CAN controller configured through its own registers. The message-ID-plus-acceptance-filter model is identical; here it is wrapped in setup macros. One naming note: Espressif calls its CAN peripheral **TWAI** (Two-Wire Automotive Interface) for trademark reasons. Every `twai_*` function is CAN.

